     <actual value="54">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first-year achievement of 54 out of 100 trained community members demonstrates substantial progress and a strong start to the project&#x2019;s capacity-building efforts with a 54.00% achievement. While the number trained so far is encouraging, continued effort is needed to reach the remaining 46 members over the remaining project periods while also ensuring that the training translates into practical implementation and positive community impact.</narrative>
